    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0141" n="25" xml:id="pg25"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.0011/9.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Emperor.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-06-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Deeply shocked at the atrocious murder of His Imperial and Royal Highness the
                    Archduke Francis Ferdinand and Consort at an assassin’s hands, I extend to Your
                    Majesty, to the Imperial and Royal Family, and to the Government of
                    Austria-Hungary the sincere condolences of the Government and people of the
                    United States and an expression of my own profound sympathy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
